1
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,000
Are you saying

2
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:24,960
You and Hao Ruichi

3
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,800
are both some kind of Lankesters?

4
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,040
No

5
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,320
Let me process this

6
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:33,720
It's simple

7
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:36,320
Actually, I wanted to tell you from the start

8
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:37,840
I just never got the chance

9
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,120
No time?

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:40,760
Is that even a valid reason?

11
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:43,160
At first, I thought it wasn’t necessary

12
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:44,120
Later on

13
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,040
I just didn’t know how to bring it up

14
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,280
I was afraid that if you knew I was a Lankester

15
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:50,560
you might reject me

16
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:52,760
And I was also scared that because of this

17
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:55,160
you might stop liking me

18
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:56,640
If you were so scared

19
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,200
why did you even say you liked me?

20
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,680
Simple, I...

21
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,640
Don’t come near me

22
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,160
Let me be alone for a while

23
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:16,440
Simple

24
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,280
You’re awake

25
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:31,560
Are you okay?

26
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:37,840
I’m fine

27
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:39,800
Maybe it’s just the heat

28
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:40,800
I’ll feel better after some sleep

29
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,840
Are you running a fever?

30
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:43,840
I said I’m fine

31
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:44,560
Don’t move

32
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,520
Once you’ve decided to stay on this planet

33
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,080
There’s something

34
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:55,080
you must know

35
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:58,040
As you know

36
00:01:58,240 --> 00:01:59,360
we Lankesters

37
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:00,720
can’t live for long

38
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,160
outside of our home planet’s environment

39
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:04,000
I stole and ate the forbidden Lanke fruit

40
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:06,080
so my body wasn’t affected much

41
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:09,560
But whether your body can adapt to Earth

42
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,840
is still an unknown

43
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,400
Have you felt any

44
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,600
unusual changes in your body recently?

45
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:24,880
My body is fine

46
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:27,960
What’s going on?

47
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:29,720
You don't have a fever either.

48
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,240
Let me know if you feel unwell, okay?

49
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,440
Promise me you'll tell me, alright?

50
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,520
Don't worry about it.

51
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,280
What's wrong?

52
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,240
Is your heart feeling uncomfortable?

53
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,800
I was kidding.

54
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:47,800
Silly!

55
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:48,920
Are you crazy?

56
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:49,880
You really gave me a scare!

57
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,320
But none of that matters.

58
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,040
Right now,

59
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,520
I have something more important to do.

60
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:04,480
Qi Miao,

61
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,160
I need to talk to Hao Ruichi.

62
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,520
Alright, you guys talk first.

63
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:11,360
I'll go check on the soup.

64
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,240
What's going on?

65
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,960
Your body is already showing signs of problems.

66
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,120
Before this moment,

67
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:25,520
you knew it yourself, right?

68
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,280
Hao Ruichi, do you really understand?

69
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,760
If you keep this up, it could be very dangerous.

70
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,040
Relax.

71
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,240
You're the same way, aren't you?

72
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:38,240
Take care of yourself.

73
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,120
I'm not the same as you.

74
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:39,880
I told you,

75
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,360
it's because I secretly ate Lan Ke's forbidden fruit.

76
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,680
There's nothing different about it.

77
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:50,480
Oh, right.

78
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:53,160
Don't tell Qi Miao about this.

79
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:54,640
Hao Ruichi,

80
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,640
if anything really happens,

81
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,640
I won't let you stay here.

82
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:15,560
It's simple.

83
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,200
I know you look down on my identity.

84
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,760
I don't expect you to accept it.

85
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,040
If you hate me,

86
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:24,480
I'll leave.

87
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,280
But before I go, I want to say something.

88
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,840
I really do like you.

89
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:35,840
Stop right there!

90
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,920
Do you even know why I'm upset?

91
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,800
It has nothing to do with who you are.

92
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,440
What upsets me is that something so serious

93
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:43,880
you decided to hide from me.

94
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,520
Am I, in your heart,

95
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,160
so unworthy of trust?

96
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:49,920
That's not what I meant.

97
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,400
I just...

98
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,600
I'm so afraid of losing you.

99
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:55,040
Idiot.

100
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,640
To be honest,

101
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:01,440
I've never been in a relationship before.

102
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:04,000
I couldn't figure out my feelings for you before.

103
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:06,560
Your confession last time was too sudden.

104
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,600
I was completely shocked.

105
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,920
But then I realized,

106
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,160
my feelings for you

107
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,640
are indeed different from what I feel for others.

108
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:16,160
So you're saying...

109
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,280
you like me too?

110
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:21,720
Come here.

111
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,760
As for me, Aiyi Te,

112
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:28,120
I've finally waited for this day.

113
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:30,760
Alright,

114
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:31,880
let go of me.

115
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:32,720
I'm not letting go.

116
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,240
Not for my entire life.

117
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:46,200
I've been eating goji berry meals for three days straight.

118
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,480
Can't I have something different?

119
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:49,280
No.

120
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,440
These are good for your health.

121
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,160
You need to take good care of yourself now.

122
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:01,400
Fine.

123
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,520
I'm fine.

124
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:03,600
You're fine too.

125
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,680
Where did you learn about this stuff?

126
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,160
Random ads.

127
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:09,920
I'm heading to the office.

128
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,880
There's a meeting today.

129
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,440
Make sure to eat properly.

130
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,000
Wait a minute.

131
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,520
The elevator incident hasn't been resolved yet.

132
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:19,840
I'm worried.

133
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,040
I'm coming with you.

134
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,320
It's fine.

135
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,640
I know what to do.

136
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,320
Let me check the magnetic field for you.

137
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,680
Let's see how I can help you.

138
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:34,080
No need.

139
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:36,160
Don't use your energy carelessly in the future.

140
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,080
It could harm your body.

141
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:39,320
Besides,

142
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:41,720
I want to earn my good fortune through my own efforts.

143
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:43,280
Trust me on this.

144
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,080
I can do it.

145
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:45,720
Alright.

146
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:47,480
From now on, after you get off work,

147
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,360
I'll come pick you up every day.

148
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,960
So be good and finish your meal.

149
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,080
Miaomiao, you're here!

150
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:08,280
I heard your 'Sweet Strike'

151
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,280
is about to hold a press conference.

152
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,960
President Xu's project has successfully wrapped up too.

153
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:12,920
President Qin also wants you to be the lead writer for the new project.

154
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,560
It's truly a triple blessing for you!

155
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:16,560
Congratulations, congratulations!

156
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:18,600
Don't forget us sisters when you soar to success!

157
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,440
I'll take your kind wishes then!

158
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,240
Qi Miao,

159
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,240
come to my office for a moment.

160
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:44,560
Teacher Jiang,

161
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:51,440
congratulations to the great screenwriter Qi Miao for all the good news!

162
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:55,720
And thank you, Teacher Jiang, for recommending me to join the team.

163
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:57,800
However, there’s something,

164
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,200
I’d like to confirm with you.

165
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,080
What is it? Go ahead.

166
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:02,640
When I was in the production team,

167
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,680
you told me to use the faulty elevator.

168
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:06,240
Don’t you think you owe me an explanation for that?

169
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:09,440
At that time,

170
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,840
I didn’t know the elevator would malfunction.

171
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,760
Teacher Jiang,

172
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:15,720
given your standing in the screenwriting circle,

173
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,040
is there any project you can’t have?

174
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,840
Why do you keep targeting me?

175
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:21,640
Because you don’t even know what I want.

176
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,560
I need to climb to a higher position.

177
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,760
Here’s the deal, Qi Miao.

178
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,760
Give me two years.

179
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:33,240
Just two years.

180
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:35,760
As long as I achieve what I want,

181
00:08:36,560 --> 00:08:38,440
I won't interfere with anything you do in the future.

182
00:08:38,800 --> 00:08:39,440
Is that okay?

183
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,160
Mr. Jiang,

184
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,839
it was you who brought me into the company,

185
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:45,440
I’ve always been deeply grateful to you

186
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:46,800
and see you as my role model.

187
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,520
If you truly are grateful to me,

188
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,360
then go and tell Mr. Qin,

189
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:53,440
tell him that 'Sweet Strike' was written by me,

190
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:55,640
and ask him to assign the upcoming projects to me as well.

191
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,040
Mr. Jiang,

192
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:58,280
you've changed.

193
00:08:58,640 --> 00:08:59,400
Qi Miao,

194
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,120
about your friend,

195
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:13,000
don't you think you should explain?

196
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,840
This is my personal matter.

197
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,200
There's nothing to explain to you.

198
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,000
I have something else to do. I need to go now.

199
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,760
Actually,

200
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:28,080
I'm not really interested in your friend.

201
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,640
I just want to get what I want.

202
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:32,360
If you don't want your friend's matter

203
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,280
to be known by more people,

204
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,680
you'd better do as I say.

205
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:40,120
Unreasonable!

206
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:41,880
Unbelievable!

207
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,520
Let me tell you, Qi Miao.

208
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,200
As long as I'm around,

209
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,720
you can forget about ever surpassing me.

210
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:55,520
There's only room for one person at the top, and that's me.

211
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:56,760
And you,

212
00:09:58,040 --> 00:10:00,000
you're not even worthy to carry my shoes.

213
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,800
Don't push me.

214
00:10:06,880 --> 00:10:07,720
Why did you call me here?

215
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,000
Qi Miao

216
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,360
You should leave first.

217
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,120
Later

218
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,320
we'll continue our conversation.

219
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,280
So it really was her deliberately framing me.

220
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:23,680
I'm done for.

221
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:51,000
Luckily, I wasn't found out.

222
00:10:59,000 --> 00:10:59,600
First of all,

223
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,840
let's welcome President Qin.

224
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:04,560
From now on, President Qin

225
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:06,680
will be one of our company's major shareholders.

226
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:08,640
I believe with President Qin's leadership,

227
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:10,720
our company is on the verge of going public.

228
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:15,000
First of all,

229
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,280
thank you all for giving me such a warm welcome.

230
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,240
I tend to speak quite frankly,

231
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:21,120
so if you have any feedback in the future,

232
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,360
feel free to come directly to my office.

233
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:24,760
That's classic Qin—straightforward and direct.

234
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:26,280
Alright,

235
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:27,840
let's get down to business.

236
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:29,200
This year,

237
00:11:29,280 --> 00:11:30,480
is a very important year for our company.

238
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:32,320
It's a critical period,

239
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:33,960
marking an important phase.

240
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,280
Because this year,

241
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:37,160
we have several major projects to kick off.

242
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:38,160
So,

243
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:38,840
everyone,

244
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:39,720
keep up the effort!

245
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:40,520
Let's do our best!

246
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:42,240
Qi Miao,

247
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:44,960
as the new screenwriter in our company,

248
00:11:45,280 --> 00:11:46,960
you're taking the lead on this project.

249
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:48,200
Of course,

250
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,160
it comes with pressure,

251
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,680
but it's also a great opportunity.

252
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:51,560
So,

253
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:52,680
work hard and make us proud!

254
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,520
Don't worry, Mr. Qin.

255
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,320
Mr. Qin,

256
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,600
it seems Qi Miao has something she wants to say.

257
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:00,720
Really?

258
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:01,320
Go on.

259
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:03,080
How about this, Mr. Qin,

260
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:04,720
I'll speak on Qi Miao's behalf.

261
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,280
For the project 'Sweet Strike,'

262
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:10,160
Qi Miao did take part in it,

263
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:12,840
but her role was mainly supportive.

264
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:15,360
She spoke to me privately,

265
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:16,920
saying for the upcoming projects,

266
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:18,520
she doesn't feel capable of handling them.

267
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:19,520
So, Mr. Qin—

268
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,160
Mr. Qin,

269
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,640
I did talk to Ms. Jiang privately,

270
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:25,200
but I never said anything like that.

271
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:30,600
Mr. Wang, Mr. Qin,

272
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,280
you should listen to this.

273
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:34,120
When we were on the set,

274
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:36,120
you asked me to get in the faulty elevator.

275
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,640
Don't you think you owe me an explanation for that?

276
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:39,520
At the time,

277
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,960
I didn't know the elevator would malfunction.
